d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈宗盛 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"海天西畔是乡关，苦忆相知未得还。\n莫道缄书空远寄，感君高义重于山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菊寄张养正 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"黄叶满空秋已残，石田秋菊自凌寒。\n香心不许游蜂采，留伴琅玕岁晚看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菊寄张养正 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"寒花采采傍云根，岁晚相依独此君。\n几度书窗夜深坐，满天风露递青芬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鹦鹉鸲鹆各一幅寄张致和 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"灵鸟能言避网罗，山林深处占高柯。\n雕盘纵有黄金粒，不肯飞来奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鹦鹉鸲鹆各一幅寄张致和 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"巧语从来众不堪，参军门下被伤残。\n山林不用人调舌，终日諵諵却自安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答夏季爵大理二首 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"南床叨接夏侯茵，待漏频年笑语亲。\n一别冬残又春半，蓟门烟树不堪人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答夏季爵大理二首 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"病骨非堪着战袍，临戎感奋却忘劳。\n三边近喜无烽火，吟望皇都紫气高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢陈少卿惠药 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"任重才荒悴此心，不堪衰病日侵寻。\n感君惠我行囊药，一颗乌丸抵万金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢陈少卿惠药 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"紫霞杯里注琼浆，一夕才吞药味良。\n有待微躯渐康复，漫寻叔子拜神方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢抚宁伯惠鱼 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"塞北沙深水泽枯，鱼虾风味四时无。\n君家鲜鲤从何致，堪比吴江一尺鲈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢抚宁伯惠鱼 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"鲜鳞传送直南金，敢效公仪却盛心。\n便遣家僮为烹荐，加餐知感故情深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日美峪至保安道中望居庸有感口占三绝 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"居庸山北忆山南，满眼西风泪未乾。\n道路相将三百里，举头不得见长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日美峪至保安道中望居庸有感口占三绝 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"京